2464964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YI4ZE","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-18T23:34:56Z","updated_at":"2024-12-18T23:45:53Z","body":"I agree with @smix8 that this feature shouldn't be a hidden miracle, but disabling it by default hurts discoverability a lot.\r\nWhat about adding an inspector button (e.g., \"Auto-assign PBR textures\") right below the material preview that opens a file dialog or directly assigns the textures if one of them was already set? This also has the advantage compared to the current approach that you have more control and can decide whether you need it on a case by case basis.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fb60046-59f0-4af8-bf39-4cf3c766ed80)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2552464964/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]